{"era":"BCE","era_year":91,"year":-90,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"是時任安為北軍使者護軍，太子立車北軍南門外，召任安，與節令發兵。安拜受節，入，閉門不出。武帝聞之，以為任安為詳邪，不傅事，何也？任安笞辱北軍錢官小吏，小吏上書言之，以為受太子節，言「幸與我其鮮好者」。書上聞，武帝曰：「是老吏也，見兵事起，欲坐觀成敗，見勝者欲合從之，有兩心。安有當死之罪甚眾，吾常活之，今懷詐，有不忠之心。」下安吏，誅死。夫月滿則虧，物盛則衰，天地之常也。知進而不知退，久乘富貴，禍積為祟。故范蠡之去越，辭不受官位，名傳後世，萬歲不忘，豈可及哉！後進者慎戒之。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-104","chapter_id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu","source_id":"s-shiji-104-tianshu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:p016","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0163","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/104.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《漢書》卷066田仁任安死亡","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=漢書/卷066&oldid=5979001","quote":"及北軍使者任安，坐受太子節，懷二心，司直田仁縱太子，皆要斬。","scope":"received_parallel_event","image_verified":false},{"title":"《漢書》卷066劉屈氂傳本年紀年","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=漢書/卷066&oldid=5979001","quote":"征和二年春","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》太子事件與紀年","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","quote":"征和元年","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r115-c01","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》太子事件與紀年","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","quote":"二","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r116-c01","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》太子事件與紀年","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","quote":"七月壬午，太子發兵，殺游擊將軍說、使者江充。","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r116-c02","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》太子事件與紀年","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","quote":"91","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r116-c00","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false}],"ba